   <narrative xml:lang="EN">oPt CAP 2010 UNRWA</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">oPt CAP 2010 UNRWA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Huvudm&#xE5;let med st&#xF6;d till UNRWA oPt &#xE4;r att f&#xF6;rse palestinska  flyktingar med st&#xF6;d - matbist&#xE5;nd, kontantst&#xF6;d, tilltr&#xE4;de till h&#xE4;lsov&#xE5;rd, utbildning och bostadssituationen. De f&#xF6;rv&#xE4;ntade  resultaten &#xE4;r att UNRWAs arbete ska minska arbetsl&#xF6;shet, f&#xF6;rb&#xE4;ttra levnadsvillkoren f&#xF6;r drabbade m&#xE4;nniskor, skapa tillf&#xE4;llga bost&#xE4;der och f&#xF6;rb&#xE4;ttra utbildningen f&#xF6;r flyktingbarn.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Main objective is providing livelihood, including food aid, job creation, cash assistance, support access to health and education and emergency shelter for destroyed houses. Main expected results can&apos;t be quantified and should be seen to reduce unemployment rates, improve living conditions for needy families, temporary shelter and learning support pupils in UNRWA school.</narrative>
  </description>
